{"name":"Butterscotch Sundae","hex":"#dbb486","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"butterscotch","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A hard candy made from butter, brown sugar, syrup and vanilla.","A sauce or syrup made of similar ingredients."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Of a light brown colour, like that of butterscotch candy.","Having the flavour of butterscotch."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/butterscotch"},{"term":"sundae","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A dessert consisting of ice cream with various toppings."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Alternative form of soondae (“Korean dish made with intestines”)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/sundae"}],"entries":[{"title":"Butterscotch","blocks":[{"text":"Butterscotch is a type of confection whose primary ingredients are brown sugar and butter. Some recipes include cream, vanilla, and salt. The earliest known recipes, in mid-19th century Yorkshire, used treacle (molasses) in place of, or in addition to, sugar."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Butterscotch-Candies.jpg/330px-Butterscotch-Candies.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Butterscotch","wikidata":"Q2009326"},{"title":"Sundae","blocks":[{"text":"A sundae is a frozen dessert that consists of ice cream topped with a sweet sauce or syrup. Its ice cream is typically scooped, and it typically has other toppings such as sprinkles, whipped cream, marshmallows, chocolate chips, M&M's, peanuts, cookies, chocolate brownies, maraschino cherries, or other fruits. It is of American origin."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ae/StrawberrySundae.jpg/330px-StrawberrySundae.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sundae","wikidata":"Q859553"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thum